{"id":"{{PREFIX}}-m3","issue_type":"milestone","title":"M3: Conversion table — 16 rows of Celsius/Fahrenheit, 0–300°C in 20° steps","description":"# Goal\nFull implementation of the temperature-conversion table. 16 rows for °C ∈ {0, 20, 40, ..., 300}. Each row's °F = °C × 9/5 + 32 (one decimal). Renders inside the existing app-root.\n\n# Definition of Done (per D18)\n- temperatureRows() pure fn + TemperatureTable component + vitest spec.\n- App.tsx replaced to render TemperatureTable in place of 'Hello world'.\n- Build + serve gates as M2.\n- Playwright finds [data-testid='temperature-table'] with exactly 16 [data-testid^='row-'] elements.\n- Cherry-picks: row-0 → 32.0, row-100 → 212.0, row-300 → 572.0.\n- npm test passes.\n","status":"open","priority":1,"labels":["acceptance","milestone:m3"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"{{PREFIX}}-m3","depends_on_id":"{{PREFIX}}-m2","type":"blocks"}],"created_at":"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z"}
