{"id":"{{PREFIX}}-8","issue_type":"task","title":"Write src/temperatureRows.ts — pure fn returning rows","description":"---\ntemplate: write-component\nfiles: src/temperatureRows.ts\n---\n\n# Goal\nPure function temperatureRows() that returns Array<{celsius: number, fahrenheit: string}> for °C ∈ {0, 20, ..., 300}. fahrenheit is the formatted-string °F (one decimal place).\n\n# Definition of Done\n- src/temperatureRows.ts present, exports temperatureRows().\n- Returns 16 entries.\n- For each entry, fahrenheit === ((celsius * 9 / 5) + 32).toFixed(1).\n","status":"open","priority":1,"labels":["acceptance","milestone:m3","template:write-component"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"{{PREFIX}}-8","depends_on_id":"{{PREFIX}}-e3","type":"parent-child"},{"issue_id":"{{PREFIX}}-8","depends_on_id":"{{PREFIX}}-m2","type":"blocks"}],"created_at":"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z"}
{"id":"{{PREFIX}}-9","issue_type":"task","title":"Write src/TemperatureTable.tsx — render rows in a <table>","description":"---\ntemplate: write-component\ntestid: temperature-table, row-{c}\nfiles: src/TemperatureTable.tsx\n---\n\n# Goal\nReact component TemperatureTable consuming temperatureRows(). Renders a <table data-testid='temperature-table'> with one <tr data-testid='row-{celsius}'> per row. Each <tr> has two <td>: the celsius value and the fahrenheit string.\n\n# Definition of Done\n- src/TemperatureTable.tsx present, default export TemperatureTable.\n- Wrapped in <table data-testid='temperature-table'>.\n- 16 <tr>s, each with data-testid='row-' + celsius.\n- Each row's two <td>s show celsius and fahrenheit (formatted).\n","status":"open","priority":1,"labels":["acceptance","milestone:m3","template:write-component"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"{{PREFIX}}-9","depends_on_id":"{{PREFIX}}-e3","type":"parent-child"},{"issue_id":"{{PREFIX}}-9","depends_on_id":"{{PREFIX}}-8","type":"blocks"}],"created_at":"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z"}
{"id":"{{PREFIX}}-10","issue_type":"task","title":"Write src/TemperatureTable.test.tsx — vitest oracle","description":"---\ntemplate: write-test\ntestid: temperature-table, row-{c}\nfiles: src/TemperatureTable.test.tsx\n---\n\n# Goal\nVitest spec asserting 16 rows, correct °F values, cherry-pick equality on row-0/row-100/row-300.\n\n# Definition of Done\n- src/TemperatureTable.test.tsx present.\n- Asserts queryAllByTestId(/^row-/).length === 16.\n- Asserts row-0 cells include '0' and '32.0'.\n- Asserts row-100 cells include '100' and '212.0'.\n- Asserts row-300 cells include '300' and '572.0'.\n- Test passes via `npm test`.\n","status":"open","priority":1,"labels":["acceptance","milestone:m3","template:write-test"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"{{PREFIX}}-10","depends_on_id":"{{PREFIX}}-e3","type":"parent-child"},{"issue_id":"{{PREFIX}}-10","depends_on_id":"{{PREFIX}}-9","type":"blocks"}],"created_at":"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z"}
